@startuml
' Figure 37.5  Incident response with the kill switch
' Reading order: top to bottom. On call is paged on an outcome objective
' and stops first with the tier the runbook names; the gateways read the
' flag; the far end's own count proves the stop; then pin, replay, and a
' fresh decision lowers the tier. From reliability.stop and runbook.
!include plantuml-theme.puml
participant "On call" as P <<ops>>
participant "Kill switch" as K <<policy>>
participant "Gateways" as G <<policy>>
participant "Far end" as F <<ops>>
P -> P : Paged
P -> K : Pull tier
K -> G : Read, 5 s
G -> F : No new calls
F -> P : Flat 20 s
P -> P : Pin, replay
P -[$POLICY]> K : Lower
@enduml
